{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which number in the array below is both the largest in its column and the smallest in its row?  (Columns go up and down, rows go right and left.)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2f94b73e928c49ee0bf3205e524e03cf1f6cfb4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}[t]{ccccc} 10 &amp; 6 &amp; 4 &amp; 3 &amp; 2 \\\\ 11 &amp; 7 &amp; 14 &amp; 10 &amp; 8 \\\\ 8 &amp; 3 &amp; 4 &amp; 5 &amp; 9 \\\\ 13 &amp; 4 &amp; 15 &amp; 12 &amp; 1 \\\\ 8 &amp; 2 &amp; 5 &amp; 9 &amp; 3 \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"91\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fa8163d9ab291a83cead4321bd7ed7fd50c08e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The largest numbers in the first, second, third, fourth and fifth columns are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40c397476106f1e600a080701ab5b208aa294505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13,7,15,12,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" /> respectively.  Of these, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the smallest in its row <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/0/02076c6f1fc41e3892111b067c6552346e510f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b